        <mxCell id="n2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;" value="NGUYEN TAC THIET KE&lt;br&gt;Vong trong nhanh va manh, vong ngoai cham va hien | moi tang them mot luong tre&lt;br&gt;Moi vong ngoai deu co duong LUI: mat flow → ANGLE, mat do cao → ga tay, mat goc → ACRO&lt;br&gt;Khau tron hy sinh GA chu khong hy sinh quyen dieu khien tu the&lt;br&gt;Yaw khong co chuan tuyet doi (chua co tu ke) nen LUON dieu khien theo toc do" vertex="1">
